"content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Use the words from the word bank to complete each sentence."}], "type": "post_instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}], "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "pdf", "content": "enpe8n7le02ob03re7pdf01.pdf"}], "type": "question"}], "responses": [{"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "id": 0}], "id": 0}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1, "id": 11}], "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "enpe8n7le02ob03re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "100", "image": "enpe8n7le02ob03re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<p><strong>Gloria</strong>: Hey Michael! What&rsquo;s new?</p>\n<p><strong>Michael</strong>: As you know, I've implemented cloud computing in my company; it&rsquo;s supposed to help a lot with our business and customers.</p>\n<p><strong>Gloria</strong>: I&rsquo;m supposed to know all about it but, what are the benefits of using cloud services?</p>\n<p><strong>Michael</strong>: Well, first and foremost, cost saving. Agents and adherents agree that this service lets companies reduce real estate cost services.</p>\n<p><strong>Gloria</strong>: So, companies aren&rsquo;t supposed to increase their fees with this service.</p>\n<p><strong>Michael</strong>: Exactly! And you know what? The staff is even supposed to be reduced.</p>"}, {"time": "35000", "image": "enpe8n7le02ob03re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<p><strong>Gloria</strong>: In this way, organizations cut down costs on salaries, office space, and the like.</p>\n<p><strong>Michael</strong>: Yes. Scalability is another important benefit. Customers are supposed to increase or decrease resources to show their needs allowing them to take advantage of business opportunities.</p>\n<p><strong>Gloria</strong>: I know that with cloud computing the quality of technical services is supposed to increase.</p>\n<p><strong>Michael</strong>: Sure. Service is the core of a company, so vendors are experts in quality and responsiveness. Moreover, cloud computing services are not supposed to work without a disaster recovery system. It has a dual purpose then, functioning service and disaster recovery service.</p>"}, {"time": "80000", "image": "enpe8n7le02ob03re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<p><strong>Gloria</strong>: And the security system is supposed to be more robust, isn't it?</p>\n<p><strong>Michael</strong>: Absolutely! Vendors aren&rsquo;t just supposed to keep information technology but personnel's information as well.</p>\n<p><strong>Gloria</strong>: Does it involve regulatory compliance?</p>\n<p><strong>Michael</strong>: Of course! Cloud computing is supposed to provide services that also involve legal and regulatory requirements of clients. Besides, savings are supposed to be made with economies of scale. Vendors can focus on using their resources proficiently.</p>\n<p><strong>Gloria</strong>: What&rsquo;s economy of scale?</p>\n<p><strong>Michael</strong>: It&rsquo;s when goods or services are produced on a larger scale with fewer input costs. Therefore, if a company grows, it will have more chances to decrease its costs.</p>"}], "coverimg": "enpe8n7le02ob03re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": ""}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "type": "scholar"}]}